ill be there ma'am.\nCustomer: Okay which model is that?\nAgent: Back Magic ma'am. Back Magic strength. Yeah. Okay. Okay I'll come down to the uh store. You're direct you're not a dealer?\nAgent: Yeah yeah no this is direct Duroflex exclusive store. And we have launched three mattresses ma'am. Uh sorry new mattress is there that one is like air boost series. You can visit our store ma'am we'll show you the all the models.\nCustomer: I'll reach by another half an hour or so okay?\nAgent: Sure sure ma'am take your own time. What's your name?\nAgent: My name is Niyamat ma'am.\nCustomer: Niyamat.\nAgent: Niyamat N I Y A M A T.\nCustomer: Okay fine thank you so much. I'll come down and uh uh confirm which one I want okay?\nAgent: Sure ma'am.\nCustomer: Thank you.\nAgent: Thank you ma'am."
