ollow up.\nCustomer: Mobile se kyun nahi hota? Email pe email kyun dalna padta hai? Mobile number confirm kar dijiye because mera mobile number registered hai aapke dukan mein. Duniya bhar ka messages aata rehta hai toh uske hisab se bhi toh aap ticket raise kar sakte ho na.\nAgent: Actually first complaint, aapko call se zyada better mail hai. Just aapko ek text karna hai ki I have purchased sofa from this Duroflex.\nCustomer: Email ID bhejiye, aap email ID bhejiye.\nAgent: Baaki woh hum khud check kar lenge sir, aap tension mat lijiye. Main aapko call karta hu Sunday ko. Hum Monday ko visit karke check kar lenge kya toota hua hai. Phir uska proper picture.\nCustomer: Kal koi nahi aa sakega kya? Kal koi nahi aa sakega kya Saturday ko?\nAgent: Nahi sir, Saturday Sunday thoda...\nCustomer: Woh toota hua bed ke upar koi so nahi sakte na. Mera ladka bahar se USA aaya hai, uska bhi ek din uske upar soye, uska back ka problem ho gaya hai. Aur yeh toh medical bed ke hisab se kharida tha, woh toh abhi ulta ho gaya hai. Back pain kam karne ke badle woh toh badha diya hai yeh.\nAgent: Sofa cum bed sir, normal bed ke compare mein jo humara wala tha woh better hai. But woh aisa orthopedic sofa cum bed nahi hoti na sir.\nCustomer: I know but then Duroflex kehte hai ki isse kuch problem nahi hota hai. Anyway aap mail dijiye yaar. Yehi takleef hota hai jab kharidne ka aur baad mein complaint ka.\nAgent: Nahi nahi aap tension mat lijiye sir, we will aapka agar woh toota hai, hum change karwa denge. Aap tension mat lijiye, agar woh toota hai toh we will change it. Main unse force karke change karwayenge.\nCustomer: Bhejiye mujhe, bhejiye email.\nAgent: Ji ji, ji main bhejta hu. Okay."
}

